"""AX 제출용 대화 기록 가림: user/assistant/system 줄만 남기고 개인정보·비밀값 가림."""
import json, re, sys

src, dst = sys.argv[1], sys.argv[2]
KEEP = {"user", "assistant", "system"}
DROP_KEYS = {"cwd", "gitBranch", "version", "entrypoint", "userType", "slug", "requestId"}

SUBS = [
    (re.compile(r"[system-reminder 제거]", re.S), "[system-reminder 제거]"),
    (re.compile(r"\d{8,11}:AA[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{30,}"), "[텔레그램 토큰 가림]"),
    (re.compile(r"[A-Za-z0-9._%+\-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.\-]+\.[A-Za-z]{2,}"), "[이메일]"),
    (re.compile(r"[텔레그램 ID]"), "[텔레그램 ID]"),
    (re.compile(r"Visa •+ ?\d{4}"), "Visa [카드 가림]"),
    (re.compile(r"[이름]|[이름] S\. Lee|[이름]|[이름]"), "[이름]"),
    (re.compile(r"[튜터]"), "[튜터]"),
    (re.compile(r"[팀원]|[팀원]"), "[팀원]"),
    (re.compile(r"[이름]|[이름]"), "[이름]"),
    (re.compile(r"hansung-(intl|startup)-[0-9a-f]+|[ntfy 주제 가림]"), "[ntfy 주제 가림]"),
]


def clean_str(s):
    for pat, rep in SUBS:
        s = pat.sub(rep, s)
    return s


def walk(o):
    if isinstance(o, dict):
        if o.get("type") == "image":
            return {"type": "text", "text": "[이미지 제거]"}
        if o.get("type") in ("thinking", "redacted_thinking"):
            return {"type": "text", "text": "[생각 과정 제거]"}
        return {k: walk(v) for k, v in o.items() if k not in DROP_KEYS}
    if isinstance(o, list):
        return [walk(x) for x in o]
    if isinstance(o, str):
        return clean_str(o)
    return o


n_in = n_out = 0
with open(src, encoding="utf-8") as f, open(dst, "w", encoding="utf-8") as g:
    for line in f:
        n_in += 1
        d = json.loads(line)
        if d.get("type") not in KEEP:
            continue
        d = walk(d)
        g.write(json.dumps(d, ensure_ascii=False) + "\n")
        n_out += 1
print(f"{n_in} lines -> {n_out} lines")

